text:
**用户：**
是文字从上滑下来。现在我看，文字是最上方的先到位，然后后续的依次到位。我们能不能让它们像拉抽屉一样，最下方的元素先出现，然后整体下滑，最上方的元素最后出现？

**AI：**
<think>用户想要的是文字行的滑入动画，但要让它们像拉抽屉一样：
- 最下方的元素先出现
- 然后整体下滑
- 最上方的元素最后出现

这是一个完全不同的动画方向。现在的动画是最上方的先到位，然后后续的依次到位。

让我看看当前的 slideInRows 实现：</think>明白了！这是**拉抽屉效果**——从底部往上依次展开。

让我看看当前的 `slideInRows` 实现：
<tool_qhPr name="package_proxy">
  <param name="params">{&quot;command&quot;: &quot;sed -n &apos;640,700p&apos; /root/kfmv4/src/client/modules/tree-render.ts&quot;}</param>
  <param name="tool_name">linux_ssh:linux_ssh_exec</param>
</tool_qhPr><tool_result_BOwO name="linux_ssh:linux_ssh_exec" status="success"><content>{"packageVersion":"0.1.0","success":true,"timeoutMs":10000,"exitCode":0,"timedOut":false,"output":"  walk(root);\n  if (closest) moveCursorTo(closest);\n}\n\n/**\n\n/**\n * SlideInRows: 收集容器内直接子行，��部上移隐藏��再逐行用 translateY 滑下。\n * 盒子链串行展开子容器，每个子容器展开后递归调用自身。\n */\nfunction slideInRows(container: Box, root: Box, selfToggle?: any): void {\n  const rows = container.children.filter(c =>\n    (c.id?.startsWith('title-') || c.id?.startsWith('file-'))\n  );\n  if (rows.length === 0) return;\n\n  const totalH = container.height;\n  const containerOrigYs = (container as any)._origYs as number[] | undefined;\n  if (containerOrigYs && container.children.length === containerOrigYs.length) {\n    container.children.forEach((c, j) => { c.y = containerOrigYs[j]; });\n  }\n  container.children.forEach(c => { c.opacity = 1; });\n  rows.forEach(r => { r.transform.translateY = -totalH; });\n  renderer?.setRoot(renderer!.getRoot()!);\n\n  // ====== 盒子链：串行展开子容器，一个完再展开下一个 ======\n  const subContainers = container.children.filter(\n    c => c.id?.startsWith('expanded-') && (c as any)._fullHeight > 0\n  );\n  function expandNext(idx: number): void {\n    if (idx >= subContainers.length) return;\n    const child = subContainers[idx];\n    const subFullH = (child as any)._fullHeight;\n    child.children.forEach(c => { c.opacity = 0; });\n    const tog = (child as any)._toggleBox;\n    if (tog) tog.transform.rotate = 0;\n    gsap.to(child, {\n      height: subFullH,\n      duration: 0.05,\n      ease: 'power2.out',\n      onUpdate: () => { renderer?.setRoot(renderer!.getRoot()!); },\n      onComplete: () => {\n        expandNext(idx + 1);\n        slideInRows(child, root, tog);\n      },\n    });\n  }\n  expandNext(0);\n\n  // ====== 当前容器 toggle 旋转（和文字链并行） ======\n  if (selfToggle) {\n    gsap.fromTo(selfToggle.transform, { rotate: 0 }, {\n      rotate: Math.PI / 2,\n      duration: 0.5,\n      ease: 'power2.out',\n      onUpdate: () => { renderer?.setRoot(renderer!.getRoot()!); },\n    });\n  }\n\n  // ====== 文字链：逐行滑入（不阻塞盒子链） ======","sessionId":"","error":""}</content></tool_result_BOwO>
<think>让我看看文字链动画的实现：</think>
